## Model card

- **Name:** Ternary Bonsai 2 27B
- **Short description:** PrismML’s Ternary Bonsai 2 27B is described in local metadata as a 1.58-bit ternary-quantized 27B model derived from Qwen3.8-27B, targeting consumer-hardware inference with ~8.6 GB footprint and 262K context.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights/self-host and hosted API routes per local metadata (`prismml/ternary-bonsai-2-27b`).
- **Release / knowledge:** Not clearly established from accessible official sources in this pass. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated.
- **IDs:** `ternary-bonsai-2-27b`, `Ternary Bonsai 2 27B`.
- **Context window:** 262,144 tokens total; 32,768 max output (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Hosted ~$0.07/$0.50 per 1M in/out; open weights $0 self-host (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** 1.58-bit ternary-quantized 27B model derived from Qwen3.8-27B (local metadata; not independently verified from accessible official model card).

